{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14218190","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14218190","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1421819001:1":{"text":"すごい！枯れてたキノコたちが……蘇ったわ！","source_cn":"好神奇！枯萎消失了……这里的生机恢复了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA22B77365AD3E783","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421819002:1":{"text":"これで、もう安心だね！","source_cn":"终于能安下心了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71AF4F99C55644E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421819003:1":{"text":"植物たちに、こんな力があったなんて……","source_cn":"原来这种植物真的有这样神奇的作用……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x082429F33466361B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421819004:1":{"text":"詳しいつもりだったけど、まだまだ知らないことばかりね。","source_cn":"我本以为自己对于这些已经知道得够多了，原来还有太多我不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F8254A7FB113950","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421819005:1":{"text":"君、地下の生態に詳しそうだね。","source_cn":"看样子你对地底的生态很了解？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x109A5952B2F82C03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421819006:1":{"text":"当然よ！この辺りの植物なら、名前も特徴も全部知ってる！だって……みんな、私の大切な友達だから。","source_cn":"那当然！这里每种植物和蕈菇的名字和习性我都知道，它们都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8E13EF8ED76A124","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421819007:1":{"text":"今はお花屋さんで修行中なの。もっと、いろんな花やキノコを育てられるようにね！","source_cn":"我现在在花店当学徒，也是为了学习照顾它们的知识，培育更...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70B243E123967A1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421819008:1":{"text":"あの……もう一度、あの本を見せてもらってもいい？きれいな植物を、もっと見たいの。","source_cn":"我还有一件事想拜托你们……我可以再看看这本书吗……我想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88E700AC82CC02DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421819009:1":{"text":"だったら、この本は君にあげるよ！もう全部覚えちゃったし。ただし――一つだけ問題が……","source_cn":"我可以把这本书送给你！反正里面的内容我已经背下来了。前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1A5A871856F2A81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421819010:1":{"text":"はぁ、またいつもの……","source_cn":"又来了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x824069022876E96B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421819011:1":{"text":"な、なに？ここの生態のことなら、知ってる限りのことは教えるけど……","source_cn":"什、什么问题？如果你们对这里的生态感兴趣，我知无不言……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1369B64CEBE8257F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1421819012:1":{"text":"あのさ、ここのジャンボキノコとトビキノコって、実は何かしらのつながりがあるんじゃない？例えば……ジャンボキノコがトビキノコに進化する、みたいな！","source_cn":"这里的巨蕈和菇灵间是不是有某种奇妙的联系？比如说……一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50B5C2627C4E6870","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421819013:1":{"text":"生物が成長とともに姿を変える「多態性」を検証する――それが、僕が魔法薬を使った理由だよ！","source_cn":"“生物在不同阶段的多态性”……验证我的伟大猜想吧！这才...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0C4626811EA3E58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1421819014:1":{"text":"検証できれば、僕の『古代王国ジャンボキノコ形態研究』が完成に一歩近づくんだ！","source_cn":"我的《古国巨蕈形态考》正在未来向我招手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3DEAF70980192E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421819015:1":{"text":"え？そんなおかしな仮説、初めて聞いた……残念だけど、あなたが想像するようなつながりはないよ。","source_cn":"啊？这是什么奇怪的猜想……很遗憾，虽然你这样迫切地看着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21D53B130914E2F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1421819016:1":{"text":"見た目がちょっと似てる、ってだけで。","sourc